alue of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs short, with February to March at 5% of normal and March to April at 15% in 2026. Over 75 years since 1951, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 42 years, more than any other pair. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, and grid 19616 bottomed out at 42% that year. The preliminary July to August 2026 estimate on grid 19616 sits at 46.2.</p>"}
